  (network egress is restricted to package registries and GitHub), so the
  live feed's real content and exact tag shape -- including the
  "?post_type=tribe_events&p=NNNN" guid format and the Yoast-style
  "The post X appeared first on Y" description boilerplate -- were
  confirmed with this session's web-fetch tool on 2026-10-19 and
  transcribed here. Re-save with a direct curl before relying on it
  long-term.

  Unlike the sanjosejazz.org fixture below, this feed's pubDate values ARE
  the actual event occurrence times -- they run forward in calendar order
  starting from "today" in the live feed, which is the signal that made us
  trust this one and distrust that one.
-->
